subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Export subscriptions

USAGE:
  subtrack export <OPTIONS> <format>

ARGUMENTS:
  format           Export format: csv, json, md, excel, ics

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                         Display this help message
  -v, --version                      Display this version
  -c, --currency <currency>          Convert all prices to target currency
  --tags <tags>                      Filter by comma-separated tags
  --status <status>                  Filter by status: active, paused, cancelled (comma-separated)
  -o, --output <output>              Output file path (default: stdout)

